        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>CVSS</choice_text>
          <commentary>CVSS이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>CWE</choice_text>
          <commentary>CWE는 소프트웨어 약점의 분류 체계이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>NVD</choice_text>
          <commentary>NVD는 미국의 취약점 정보 저장소이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="11" id="PRB-9387E552A2FD8C5F-Q11">
