      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>1</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>alert</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 정보시스템보안 · syslog 우선순위
정답은 ①이다. syslog의 우선순위는 emerg &gt; alert &gt; crit &gt; err &gt; warning &gt; notice &gt; info &gt; debug 순이다. 보기 중 가장 높은 것은 alert이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>alert</choice_text>
          <commentary>alert이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>crit</choice_text>
          <commentary>crit는 alert보다 낮다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>err</choice_text>
          <commentary>err는 crit보다 낮다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>debug</choice_text>
          <commentary>debug는 가장 낮다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="16" id="PRB-9387E552A2FD8C5F-Q16">
      <question_stem>웹 취약점에 대한 설명으로 옳지 않은 것은?</question_stem>
